{"seq":1,"slug":"index-strategy","title":"索引策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/performance-tuning/index-strategy","wordCount":818,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"索引策略\">索引策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>索引是数据库性能优化的第一道防线。索引通过维护数据的有序结构，将查询从全表扫描（O(N)）降低到对数级别查找（O(log N)）。但索引并非越多越好——每个索引都增加写入开销和存储空间。索引策略的核心是在读性能和写性能之间找到最优平衡点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[索引类型] --&gt; B[B-Tree]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Hash]&#10;    A --&gt; D[GIN]&#10;    A --&gt; E[GiST]&#10;    A --&gt; F[BRIN]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[默认类型,支持范围和等值查询]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[仅等值查询,不支持范围]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[全文搜索、数组、JSONB]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[空间数据、范围类型]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[大表顺序数据,极小索引]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 选择依据&#10;        G[查询模式]&#10;        H[数据特征]&#10;        I[写入频率]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[索引类型] --&gt; B[B-Tree]\n    A --&gt; C[Hash]\n    A --&gt; D[GIN]\n    A --&gt; E[GiST]\n    A --&gt; F[BRIN]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[默认类型,支持范围和等值查询]\n    C --&gt; C1[仅等值查询,不支持范围]\n    D --&gt; D1[全文搜索、数组、JSONB]\n    E --&gt; E1[空间数据、范围类型]\n    F --&gt; F1[大表顺序数据,极小索引]\n\n    subgraph 选择依据\n        G[查询模式]\n        H[数据特征]\n        I[写入频率]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>支持的操作</th>\n<th>存储开销</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>数据库支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>B-Tree</td>\n<td>=, &lt;, &gt;, BETWEEN, LIKE 前缀</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>通用场景</td>\n<td>所有主流 DB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hash</td>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>纯等值查找</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL, MySQL 8.0+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GIN</td>\n<td>包含、全文搜索、数组</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>JSONB、tsvector、array</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GiST</td>\n<td>空间查询、范围重叠</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>PostGIS、范围类型</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BRIN</td>\n<td>范围过滤</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>时序数据、顺序写入</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"复合索引设计\">复合索引设计</h2><p>复合索引（Composite Index）包含多个列，其列顺序决定了索引的可用性。理解&quot;最左前缀原则&quot;是设计复合索引的基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const compositeIndex = `&#10;-- 复合索引 (a, b, c)&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_abc ON orders(status, user_id, created_at);&#10;&#10;-- 可以利用该索引的查询模式&#10;WHERE status = 1                                    -- 使用 (a)&#10;WHERE status = 1 AND user_id = 100                  -- 使用 (a, b)&#10;WHERE status = 1 AND user_id = 100 AND created_at &gt; -- 使用 (a, b, c)&#10;WHERE status = 1 AND created_at &gt; &#39;2024-01-01&#39;      -- 使用 (a)，跳过 b&#10;&#10;-- 无法利用该索引的查询&#10;WHERE user_id = 100                                 -- 不以 a 开头&#10;WHERE created_at &gt; &#39;2024-01-01&#39;                     -- 不以 a 开头&#10;&#10;-- ESR 规则：Equal → Sort → Range&#10;-- 等值条件列放前面，排序列居中，范围条件列放后面&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_esr ON orders(status, created_at, amount);&#10;-- 完美支持：WHERE status = 1 ORDER BY created_at WHERE amount &gt; 100&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> compositeIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 复合索引 (a, b, c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_abc ON orders(status, user_id, created_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 可以利用该索引的查询模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE status = 1                                    -- 使用 (a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE status = 1 AND user_id = 100                  -- 使用 (a, b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE status = 1 AND user_id = 100 AND created_at > -- 使用 (a, b, c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE status = 1 AND created_at > '2024-01-01'      -- 使用 (a)，跳过 b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 无法利用该索引的查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE user_id = 100                                 -- 不以 a 开头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE created_at > '2024-01-01'                     -- 不以 a 开头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- ESR 规则：Equal → Sort → Range</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 等值条件列放前面，排序列居中，范围条件列放后面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_esr ON orders(status, created_at, amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 完美支持：WHERE status = 1 ORDER BY created_at WHERE amount > 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>复合索引的列顺序设计遵循 <strong>ESR 规则（Equal-Sort-Range）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>顺序</th>\n<th>放置列类型</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第 1</td>\n<td>等值过滤列</td>\n<td>精确定位起始位置</td>\n<td>status = 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 2</td>\n<td>排序列</td>\n<td>索引已排序，避免 filesort</td>\n<td>ORDER BY created_at</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 3</td>\n<td>范围过滤列</td>\n<td>范围条件中断索引使用</td>\n<td>amount &gt; 100</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖索引与-index-only-scan\">覆盖索引与 Index-Only Scan</h2><p>覆盖索引（Covering Index）包含查询所需的所有列，使数据库无需访问表数据（&quot;回表&quot;），直接从索引返回结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const coveringIndex = `&#10;-- 创建覆盖索引（包含查询需要的所有列）&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_covering ON orders(user_id, status) &#10;    INCLUDE (amount, created_at);&#10;&#10;-- 此查询可以完全从索引满足（Index-Only Scan）&#10;SELECT user_id, status, amount, created_at&#10;FROM orders&#10;WHERE user_id = 100 AND status = 1;&#10;&#10;-- PostgreSQL INCLUDE 语法（额外列不参与索引排序）&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_user_orders ON orders(user_id) &#10;    INCLUDE (amount, order_date);&#10;&#10;-- 验证是否 Index-Only Scan&#10;EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS) SELECT ...;&#10;-- 查看 &quot;Index Only Scan&quot; 或 &quot;Heap Fetches: 0&quot;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coveringIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 创建覆盖索引（包含查询需要的所有列）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_covering ON orders(user_id, status) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    INCLUDE (amount, created_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 此查询可以完全从索引满足（Index-Only Scan）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT user_id, status, amount, created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE user_id = 100 AND status = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- PostgreSQL INCLUDE 语法（额外列不参与索引排序）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_user_orders ON orders(user_id) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    INCLUDE (amount, order_date);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 验证是否 Index-Only Scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS) SELECT ...;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查看 \"Index Only Scan\" 或 \"Heap Fetches: 0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>覆盖索引的代价是增加了索引大小。INCLUDE 列不参与索引的排序和搜索，只作为额外数据存储在叶子节点中。这比把所有列都放进索引键更高效，因为索引键越短，每个页面能存储的条目越多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部分索引与表达式索引\">部分索引与表达式索引</h2><p>部分索引（Partial Index）只对满足条件的行建立索引，减少索引大小和维护开销。表达式索引对函数计算结果建立索引。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const specialIndexes = `&#10;-- 部分索引：只索引活跃记录&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_active_users ON users(email) &#10;    WHERE status = 1;&#10;&#10;-- 效果：对 status = 1 的查询更快，索引更小&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = &#39;alice@example.com&#39; AND status = 1;&#10;&#10;-- 部分索引：只索引未处理的订单&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_pending_orders ON orders(created_at) &#10;    WHERE status = 0;&#10;&#10;-- 表达式索引：对函数结果建索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_lower_email ON users(LOWER(email));&#10;-- 查询必须使用相同的表达式&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE LOWER(email) = &#39;alice@example.com&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- JSONB 表达式索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_metadata_type ON events((metadata-&gt;&gt;&#39;type&#39;));&#10;SELECT * FROM events WHERE metadata-&gt;&gt;&#39;type&#39; = &#39;click&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 唯一部分索引（条件唯一约束）&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_unique_active_email &#10;    ON users(email) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> specialIndexes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 部分索引：只索引活跃记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_active_users ON users(email) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE status = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 效果：对 status = 1 的查询更快，索引更小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = 'alice@example.com' AND status = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 部分索引：只索引未处理的订单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_pending_orders ON orders(created_at) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE status = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 表达式索引：对函数结果建索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_lower_email ON users(LOWER(email));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查询必须使用相同的表达式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users WHERE LOWER(email) = 'alice@example.com';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- JSONB 表达式索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_metadata_type ON events((metadata->>'type'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM events WHERE metadata->>'type' = 'click';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 唯一部分索引（条件唯一约束）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_unique_active_email </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ON users(email) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>索引大小</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通索引</td>\n<td>CREATE INDEX ...</td>\n<td>全量</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分索引</td>\n<td>WHERE condition</td>\n<td>更小</td>\n<td>热数据/状态过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达式索引</td>\n<td>ON (expression)</td>\n<td>同普通</td>\n<td>函数查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>唯一部分索引</td>\n<td>UNIQUE ... WHERE</td>\n<td>更小</td>\n<td>条件唯一约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"索引维护与诊断\">索引维护与诊断</h2><p>索引需要持续维护。随着数据的增删改，索引可能出现碎片化（膨胀），性能逐渐下降。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const indexMaintenance = `&#10;-- 查看索引使用情况（PostgreSQL）&#10;SELECT &#10;    schemaname, tablename, indexname,&#10;    idx_scan AS index_scans,&#10;    idx_tup_read AS tuples_read,&#10;    idx_tup_fetch AS tuples_fetched,&#10;    pg_size_pretty(pg_relation_size(indexrelid)) AS index_size&#10;FROM pg_stat_user_indexes&#10;ORDER BY idx_scan ASC;&#10;&#10;-- 查找未使用的索引（浪费空间和写入性能）&#10;SELECT indexname, idx_scan&#10;FROM pg_stat_user_indexes&#10;WHERE idx_scan = 0 AND schemaname = &#39;public&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 查看索引膨胀&#10;SELECT &#10;    tablename,&#10;    pg_size_pretty(pg_total_relation_size(tablename::regclass)) AS total_size,&#10;    pg_size_pretty(pg_indexes_size(tablename::regclass)) AS index_size&#10;FROM pg_tables&#10;WHERE schemaname = &#39;public&#39;&#10;ORDER BY pg_total_relation_size(tablename::regclass) DESC;&#10;&#10;-- 重建膨胀的索引&#10;REINDEX INDEX CONCURRENTLY idx_orders_user_id;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> indexMaintenance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查看索引使用情况（PostgreSQL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    schemaname, tablename, indexname,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    idx_scan AS index_scans,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    idx_tup_read AS tuples_read,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    idx_tup_fetch AS tuples_fetched,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    pg_size_pretty(pg_relation_size(indexrelid)) AS index_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM pg_stat_user_indexes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY idx_scan ASC;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查找未使用的索引（浪费空间和写入性能）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT indexname, idx_scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM pg_stat_user_indexes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE idx_scan = 0 AND schemaname = 'public';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查看索引膨胀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    tablename,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    pg_size_pretty(pg_total_relation_size(tablename::regclass)) AS total_size,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    pg_size_pretty(pg_indexes_size(tablename::regclass)) AS index_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM pg_tables</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE schemaname = 'public'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY pg_total_relation_size(tablename::regclass) DESC;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 重建膨胀的索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">REINDEX INDEX CONCURRENTLY idx_orders_user_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>定期审查索引：删除未使用的索引减少写入开销，重建膨胀的索引恢复查询性能，合并功能重叠的索引简化维护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>B-Tree 是默认索引类型，覆盖等值和范围查询；GIN 用于全文搜索和 JSONB；BRIN 适合时序大表</li>\n<li>复合索引遵循 ESR 规则：等值列优先、排序列居中、范围列末尾</li>\n<li>覆盖索引通过 INCLUDE 避免回表，实现 Index-Only Scan</li>\n<li>部分索引只对满足条件的行建索引，显著减少索引大小和维护开销</li>\n<li>表达式索引对函数计算结果建索引，查询必须使用完全相同的表达式</li>\n<li>定期审查未使用索引、重建膨胀索引是索引维护的核心工作</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"索引策略","id":"索引策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"复合索引设计","id":"复合索引设计"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖索引与 Index-Only Scan","id":"覆盖索引与-index-only-scan"},{"level":2,"text":"部分索引与表达式索引","id":"部分索引与表达式索引"},{"level":2,"text":"索引维护与诊断","id":"索引维护与诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"集合操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/set-operations"},"next":{"title":"执行计划解读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/performance-tuning/query-plans"}}